---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Who I Work With | Nikki Leonardi Bodywork Traverse City" description="Therapeutic massage for athletes, active people, and chronic pain — Traverse City's root-cause specialist. 13 years. 5.0 on Google.">
  <div class="pt-16">

    <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-[#162040]">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <p class="section-label mb-6">Who I Work With</p>
        <h1 class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-5xl md:text-6xl text-[#f0f4ff] leading-tight mb-6">
          Not everyone.<br/><em class="text-[#c8a84b]">The right people.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-[#c8a84b]/60 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
          Nikki doesn't work with everyone — and that's intentional. The clients she takes on, she's fully committed to. Here's who she works best with.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Athletes -->
    <section id="athletes" class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#0d1428]">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <p class="section-label mb-6">Athletes & Active People</p>
        <h2 class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-4xl text-[#f0f4ff] mb-8 leading-tight">
          For people who use their body hard<br/><em class="text-[#c8a84b]">and need it to work.</em>
        </h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
          <div class="space-y-5 text-[#c8a84b]/70 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Trail runners. Cyclists. Gym athletes. Yoga practitioners. People who train hard and feel every accumulation of that training in their body.</p>
            <p>The work I do for active people isn't about recovery in the spa sense. It's about understanding what your training is doing to your tissue — the fascial restrictions building up from repetitive motion, the structural imbalances your body has been compensating around, the tightness that's affecting your stride, your range of motion, your output.</p>
            <p>I've been trail running in Traverse City for years. I know this body type. I know what it carries.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div class="border border-white/10 p-6">
              <p class="text-[#f0f4ff]/80 text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-3">"It felt like years of pushups, chatarangas, burpees and mountain-climbers melted away."</p>
              <div class="gold-line mb-2"></div>
              <p class="text-[#c8a84b]/40 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">Barbara Sennrich</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-white/10 p-6">
              <p class="text-[#f0f4ff]/80 text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-3">"She worked my whole body, which most therapists don't. She was very intuitive the whole time. She is worth every dollar and a good tip."</p>
              <div class="gold-line mb-2"></div>
              <p class="text-[#c8a84b]/40 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">Sasha King, LMT & Competitive Athlete</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10">
          <a href="/book" class="btn-primary">Book a Session</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Chronic Pain -->
    <section id="chronic-pain" class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#162040]">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <p class="section-label mb-6">Chronic Pain & Recovery</p>
        <h2 class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-4xl text-[#f0f4ff] mb-8 leading-tight">
          For people who have tried everything else<br/><em class="text-[#c8a84b]">and are tired of managing it.</em>
        </h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
          <div class="space-y-5 text-[#c8a84b]/70 leading-relaxed">
            <p>You know the pattern. Something hurts. You stretch it, ice it, see the chiropractor. It gets better for a while. Then you're back.</p>
            <p>The reason it keeps coming back is usually that the root cause hasn't been addressed — the fascial restriction, the structural imbalance, the compensatory pattern your body developed years ago that nobody has found yet.</p>
            <p>That's the conversation I want to have.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div class="border border-[#c8a84b]/20 p-6 bg-[#1e2d52]/30">
              <p class="text-[#f0f4ff]/80 text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-3">"I have battled lower back and upper back issues for quite a few years. I've done the whole chiropractor thing and it works for a little while but have to go back quite regularly. I told my chiropractor about Nikki and she said 'I have to meet this Nikki — she has fixed 3 of my patients over the last year.' Nikki has made it so that those symptoms are gone 95 percent of the time for me."</p>
              <div class="gold-line mb-2"></div>
              <p class="text-[#c8a84b]/40 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">Adam</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-white/10 p-6">
              <p class="text-[#f0f4ff]/80 text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-3">"I had been experiencing a lot of aches and pains, stress in the neck and shoulders as well as tension headaches and migraines... It has made a huge difference in my every day activity when seeing her on a regular basis."</p>
              <div class="gold-line mb-2"></div>
              <p class="text-[#c8a84b]/40 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">Michelle Mitchell</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10">
          <a href="/book" class="btn-primary">Book a Session</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>
